# Public mirror of markov's skills monorepo.
#
# Only published skill artifacts belong here. Each top-level directory is the
# promoted content of one skill's artifact folder, written by the private
# monorepo's scripts/publish.sh — nothing is authored in this repo directly.
#
# The private engineering record (ADRs, tasks, audits, research, lessons,
# feedback, handoffs) and every dev/ factory tree stay in the private monorepo.
# publish.sh already excludes them by construction; these patterns are the
# second line of defence, so a hand-copied directory cannot be committed by
# accident.
#
# Patterns are ANCHORED (leading /) on purpose. An unanchored `tests/` would
# also ignore legitimately shipped artifact code such as
# writing/scripts/vale/tests/ and debate/scripts/lib/debate/tasks/.

# Private engineering record at the repository root
/.private/
/scratch/
/tests/
/tasks/
/adr/
/audits/
/research/
/lessons/
/feedback/
/handoffs/
/docs/tasks/
/docs/adr/
/docs/audits/
/docs/research/
/docs/lessons/
/docs/feedback/
/docs/handoffs/

# Development factory trees never ship
**/dev/

# Build and tooling cruft
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.hypothesis/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
